# fraction_connected counts index-1 saddles whose endpoints pass the eOn r2205 link. The catalogue goal is 27 unique saddles under 1.5 eV. The last one is search 632, barrier 1.483 eV. The next 160 searches added none. The runner exits after 160 searches with no new unique saddle under that window once 200 searches have run.
# fraction_eon_connected is the eOn r2205 link: exactly one endpoint has perAtomNorm strictly below distance_difference 0.1 angstrom. A connected index-1 saddle is a harness success. Both endpoint minima are in pykmc-0.0.1-saddle-search-pt-island--pykmc-saddle-pt.endpoints.jsonl.
# Potential is morse_shift. The 2014 Pt archive used shifted Morse. Smooth-linear is a separate labelled row.
# Failure classes are optbench.failures.apply_taxonomy. 512 successes, 210 wrong_stationary, 69 crash, 1 not_converged. No divergence and no harness cap. The 69 crashes store ErrorType.EVENT_NOT_FOUND. The not_converged search stopped on the method budget at 10000 calls, under the harness cap of 20000. Search 88 is linked and at the force stop with Hessian index 2, so it is wrong_stationary and is the extra eon_connected count.
